{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlesExternalEvents"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"matching"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"conditions"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This modifier is only supported for WindowGroup Scene types.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For DocumentGroups, the received External Event must have a URL","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for the DocumentGroup to be considered. (Either via openURL, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the webPageURL property of an NSUserActivity). The UTI for the URL","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is implicitly matched against the DocumentGroup’s supported types.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the modifier evaluates to true, an instance of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Scene will be used."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the modifier evaluates to false, on macOS the Scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will not be used even if no other Scenes are available."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This case is considered an error. On iOS, the first Scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specified in the body property for the App will be used."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If no modifier is set, the Scene will be used if all"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other WindowGroups with a modifier evaluate to false."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On platforms that only allow a single Window\/Scene, this method is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/swift\/never\/handlesexternalevents(matching:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"title":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"handlesExternalEvents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"matching","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE21handlesExternalEvents8matchingQrShySSG_tF::SYNTHESIZED::s:s5NeverO"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Swift\/Never\/handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Specifies a modifier to indicate if this Scene can be used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when creat